ubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-02T15:00:14Z","updated_at":"2025-05-02T15:00:14Z","body":"@syntaxerror247 I just tested it and it's looking good, great job!\r\n\r\nI have some minor usability feedback:\r\n- When collapsed, all the other items with text in the top row (workspace labels, renderer label) are bolded. Can the same treatment be applied to the `Main Menu` label\r\n- Can you increase the padding for the main menu pop-up to be the same as the one used for the touch panel. The entries in the main menu pop-up feel cramped and harder to hit compared to the icons in the touch panel \r\n- Can you add a visible border outline to the touch panel\r\n- Can you top-align the touch panel when it's embedded. The border outline mentioned above would provide visual distinction between the main menu and the touch panel when embedded on the left or the renderer menu and the touch panel when embedded on the right\r\n- Can you left-align the main menu icon so it's aligned with the touch panel icons when embedded on the left","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2847416972/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,